l duration-300 ease-out\r\n\n                       hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_10px_25px_rgba(235,66,3,0.35)]\r\n\n                       active:translate-y-0 active:scale-[0.98]\" style=\"background:#EB4203\" href=\"/#upload\"><span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-1.5\">Upload Image<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full bg-gradient-to-r\r\n\n                         from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent\r\n\n                         transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-full\"></span></a></div><button aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors duration-300 md:hidden\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\"><div class=\"relative h-4 w-5\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 h-[2px] w-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;top:2px;transform:none\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[7px] h-[2px] w-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;opacity:1;transform:none\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 h-[2px] w-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;top:12px;transform:none\"></span></div></button></div><div class=\"fixed inset-0 top-0 -z-10 md:hidden transition-opacity duration-300\n          pointer-events-none opacity-0\" style=\"background:rgba(255, 241, 239, 0.96);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><div class=\"mt-20 flex flex-col gap-2 px-6 transition-all duration-500\n            -translate-y-4 opacity-0\"><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white\r\n\n                       transition-transform duration-300 active:scale-[0.98]\" style=\"background:#EB4203\" href=\"/#upload\">Upload Image →</a><p class=\"mt-6 px-4 text-center text-xs\" style=\"color:#8a7a77\">Free · No signup · No uploads</p></div></div></header><main style=\"max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:120px 20px 80px;min-height:100vh\"><h1 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:24px\">About <span style=\"color:#EB4203\">BgRemove</span></h1><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">BgRemove is a free online background remover. Choose a PNG, JPG, or WEBP image, process it in your browser, and download a transparent PNG without creating an account. BgRemove does not add a watermark.</p><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin-top:16px\"><a style=\"color:#EB4203;font-weight:600\" href=\"/#upload\">Open the background remover</a></p><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:36px;margin-bottom:12px\">How it works</h2><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">BgRemove uses an on-device model in your browser via WebAssembly. The selected image is processed in the browser rather than sent to the application server for removal. Your browser does request the website and model files needed to run the tool. The download is a PNG on a 3840 × 2160 canvas; that canvas size does not add detail to a small source image.</p><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:36px;margin-bottom:12px\">Who it&#x27;s for</h2><ul style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:22px\"><li>People preparing product photos and listing images.</li><li>Designers who need a transparent PNG cutout.</li><li>People editing profile images, thumbnails, or presentations.</li><li>People preparing document photos, subject to the issuing authority&#x27;s rules.</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:36px;margin-bottom:12px\">Pricing</h2><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">BgRemove is free to use and does not require an account. The tool does not add a watermark to its PNG download.</p><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:36px;margin-bottom:12px\">Review the result</h2><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">Automatic cutouts can miss fine or low-contrast edges. Check the downloaded image at its intended size. If you are preparing a product listing or official document photo, check the destination&#x27;s current requirements too. Read our<!-- --> <a style=\"color:#EB4203\" href=\"/privacy\">privacy policy</a>.</p></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(235, 66, 3, 0.18);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,241,239,0) 0%, rgba(235,66,3,0.04)